# Summary of memory orderings

| Operation | Ordering | Why |
|---|---|---|
| producer loads `tail_` | `relaxed` | producer owns `tail_`; no cross-thread sync needed |
| producer loads `head_` | `acquire` | must observe consumer’s slot reclamation before reusing slot |
| producer stores `tail_` | `release` | publishes newly constructed element |
| consumer loads `head_` | `relaxed` | consumer owns `head_`; no cross-thread sync needed |
| consumer loads `tail_` | `acquire` | must observe producer’s element construction before reading slot |
| consumer stores `head_` | `release` | publishes that slot is free after read/destruction |

